# Local editor, assistant, and orchestration state. None of it has ever been
# tracked; this keeps an accidental `git add -A` from being the first time.
.assistant*/
.agent*/
.editor-state/
*_INSTRUCTIONS.md
.mcp.json
**/session-*.json
**/transcript-*.jsonl

# Assistant and orchestration state. None of it is part of the project, and a
# stray CLAUDE.md or .codex/ in a public repository is noise at best.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.codex/
.codex-*/
.maestro/
.cursor/
.aider*
.windsurf/

# Cached embeddings for the claim reader: 6.6 MB, regenerable from the corpus
# with `scripts/train_claim_reader.py --embed`. The head they produce is what
# ships, and it is 31 KB.
data/claims/reader/*-embeddings.npz
